+# The widget paths of assert-paths.sh, which reach every caption rule, every
+# checked ground and every icon colour of the shipped sheets. A row holds the
+# ground class, the ground role, the path, the caption role and the dialect.
+
+# A dash in a field drops the check of that field, and an empty dialect field
+# holds both dialects. The caption field can hold a property before the role,
+# such as border:error_color_breeze, and a circumflex marks an inherited
+# colour.
+
+# A caption follows the colour scheme only over a ground that follows it. It
+# then reads the foreground name of the group of that ground. A user file
+# moves one group at a time, so a caption of another group can lose its
+# contrast.
+
+# The window, the flat button and the link.
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background label | theme_fg_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background label:disabled | insensitive_fg_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background button.flat | theme_fg_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background button.flat label | theme_fg_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background button.flat label:disabled | insensitive_fg_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background button.link | link_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background button.link label | link_color_breeze |
+follow | theme_bg_color_breeze | window.background label.link | link_color_breeze |
+
